AB  - Generative AI (GenAI) can revolutionize release management, this research ensuring confidentiality and efficiency in software delivery. This research proposes a conceptual framework combining embedding journals, Large Language Models (LLMs), and Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) to automate code reviews, testing, and deployments within Development-Security-Operations (DevSecOps) pipelines. By integrating GenAI into Continues Integration Development (CI/CD) and security processes, these approach safeguards sensitive assets, streamlines concurrent engineering, and cuts lead times. The findings underline GenAI’s capacity to optimize resource utilization and fortify data privacy across the software lifecycle, offering a roadmap for adopting AI-driven practices that respond swiftly to evolving development demands.
