T1  - Cybersecurity risks, DevSecOps challenges, and emerging security priorities: An empirical study across Brazilian organizations
AU  - Canedo, Edna Dias
AU  - Spósito, Stefano Luppi
AU  - Peotta, Laerte
AU  - Nunes, Rafael Rabelo
AU  - Ladeira, Marcelo
JO  - Computers & Security
VL  - 170
SP  - 105026
